This solution precomputes all needed fr(n) values efficiently using DP and divisor relationships, then answers queries directly from the precomputed table. The time complexity is O(MAX_R * MAX_N * log(MAX_N)) preprocessing plus O(Q) for queries, which handles the constraint of 10^6 queries with r, n up to 10^6.

